            "review_text": "psklwg\nParis, France16 contributions\n0\nAverage\nFeb 2019 • Solo\nWent there because of good reviews \nWhere is the good taste ?\nAll I can say is that locals come here it's absolutely true. Can't deny it.\nIt's way too much meat and not enough seasoning. Just average. It cannot be too bad because it's just a sandwich.\nPlus, one local lady bought 3 banh mi, handed over a 50k and had change so I assume it's 15k each\nSo I gave a 20k and no change\nWtf?\nWant to try a good one ? Go to hoi an. Just look for the best in google. It's there. Not here near the golden bridge\nRead more\nWritten February 2, 2019",
