            "review_title": "Review at Banh My Ba Lan",
            "review_text": "Rene J\nBrisbane, Australia76 contributions\n0\nIt is the best Bahn My in yown\nJan 2019 • Family\nStreet food at it’s best. We ordered all three types of Bahn My in both traditional and vegetarian versions. All were amazing. There is an option of adding chili which is not too spicy and tastes delicious.\n\nVery popular with locals there usually is a queue but the wait is not long as the Bahn My are served at record pace. We managed to feed 8 people for VND145,000.\n\nThere are many Bahn My vendors nearby but this one is definitely worth searching for.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2019",
